//// 1.0.12-beta `1-botopink-lang/144` B-00k (decision 453) — the package name
//// `std` is the bundled standard library's alone. A project whose
//// `botopink.json` names itself `std` is refused at its manifest, located at
//// the name, on every target: the name `std` is never one a user can take, so
//// an import from "std", a `std:` cell (decision 445) and `bpmp` read it as
//// one package. The parent of the group (`239f789f`) built and ran this
//// project as any other and printed `hello` on the four targets.

pub fn main() {
    @print("hello");
}
